WEBVTT

00:00:00.408 --> 00:00:05.540
In this video, you will see what is free on SoCal Lights, and what the paid options are.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.531
Nothing here asks for payment.

00:00:07.531 --> 00:00:08.632
We start on the map.

00:00:09.473 --> 00:00:11.233
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.898 --> 00:00:16.448
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:19.105
Then tap Allow.

00:00:21.923 --> 00:00:27.195
The Pricing page is linked at the bottom of every page, and you can always go straight to it.

00:00:27.195 --> 00:00:31.465
Finding lights and events is free, and so is posting them.

00:00:31.465 --> 00:00:35.027
Paid options only make your listing easier to see.

00:00:35.027 --> 00:00:43.733
At the top are four tabs, one for each kind of visitor: Homeowners, Event organizers, Contest organizers, and Installers.

00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:45.224
Homeowners first.

00:00:45.224 --> 00:00:48.602
Adding your home, and entering a contest, are free.

00:00:48.602 --> 00:00:57.582
A contest winner, second, or third place can also feature their home for thirty days: a Featured pin is ten dollars, and the top of the list is fifteen.

00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:01.850
Next, Event organizers.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.680
Listing your event is free.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.857
Featured placement is optional.

00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:08.326
A Featured pin is twenty five dollars.

00:01:08.326 --> 00:01:11.533
Add the banner, or the top of the list, and it is fifty.

00:01:11.533 --> 00:01:13.400
All three is seventy five.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.070
You pay once, with no subscription.

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.159
Contest organizers next.

00:01:18.159 --> 00:01:20.553
Residents enter and vote for free.

00:01:20.553 --> 00:01:22.709
An organizer chooses a pass.

00:01:22.709 --> 00:01:25.793
One contest is one hundred forty nine dollars.

00:01:25.793 --> 00:01:28.654
Up to five contests is two ninety nine.

00:01:28.654 --> 00:01:32.568
Up to twenty is four ninety nine, in a twelve month window.

00:01:32.568 --> 00:01:34.600
A pass counts contests only.

00:01:37.117 --> 00:01:38.414
And Installers.

00:01:38.414 --> 00:01:41.603
A profile card with your company page is free.

00:01:41.603 --> 00:01:50.663
Paid placements are always labeled Sponsor: a banner is fifty dollars for the season, the top of the list is fifty, and both together are seventy five.

00:01:53.008 --> 00:01:54.779
At the bottom is Good to know.

00:01:54.779 --> 00:01:58.797
It answers how you pay, what season means, and refunds.

00:01:58.797 --> 00:02:01.259
Payments are on Stripe's secure page.

00:02:01.259 --> 00:02:04.548
And paying never changes who wins a contest.

00:02:04.548 --> 00:02:06.615
That is pricing, in two minutes.

00:02:06.615 --> 00:02:09.167
Finding lights is free, and always will be.

00:02:10.536 --> 00:02:12.499
Next up: Find lights near me.
